research-highlight-ai-prefs-provider-note = Selecting Groq, OpenAI, or OpenRouter fills the matching Chat Completions endpoint and a recommended model. Endpoint and Model remain editable. Custom is for OpenAI Chat Completions-compatible endpoints that support JSON Schema Structured Outputs.
research-highlight-ai-prefs-key-note = The API key is stored locally in Zotero preferences and is never written to the repository. The API key may be left blank for Custom endpoints that do not require authentication.
research-highlight-ai-prefs-auto-note = Keep this off while the old Actions & Tags auto-annotation action is still enabled, or both automations may process the same highlight.
